00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.680
We are building tools
to simplify and automate

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.884
repeatable tasks.

00:00:29.884 --> 00:00:32.009
So repeatable tasks, you
can think of-- the example

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:34.780
that we are going to do
today is based on analytics.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.990
One of the analytics
tasks that marketers do,

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.970
they get data from
