00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:53.160
So a few engineering things
that we keep on our side

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.260
as a [INAUDIBLE]
engineering team is,

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.850
keep everything simple.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.610
Make things scale on demand.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:03.180
And use machine learning
to augment the uses

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:06.930
that we have of our technology.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:09.270
A machine learning
solution is more than just

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.680
